<title>DUBAI: KPC raises posted product prices.</title>
<headline>KPC raises posted product prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) said it had increased its product posted prices fob Kuwait, effective Thursday.</p>
<p>Naphtha is 1.5 cents a gallon up at 50.50 cents, gas oil 2.5 cents a gallon higher at 68.50 cents, high sulphur fuel oil up by 50 cents a barrel to $17.50 and marine diesel is increased by $1 a barrel to $26.00.</p>
</text>
